{"deck": "wrinkle_rumble", "coverOffset": 1, "pdfPages": 13, "cards": [{"n": 1, "text": ["THE PROBOSCIS", "OF DOOM", "POWER", "Eavesdrop: Look at the top", "3 cards of the deck. Groan", "loudly at what you see.", "LORE", "As the body fails, the sensors", "expand. You will hear every", "insult whispered by the youth.", "IA]", "[R]", "[F]"], "page": 2, "quad": 0}, {"page": 2, "text": ["THE CHATTER-CHOMPERS", "POWER", "Swap Equipment: Steal an item from a", "player. Give them \"Gingivitis® in return.", "[R]", "LORE: The indignity isn't losing your teeth; it's", "accidentally wearing your enemy's smile."], "quad": 1, "n": 2}, {"quad": 2, "n": 3, "page": 2, "text": ["THE WRINKLE-", "STORM", "POWER:", "Collision: Destroy 1 Future", "Timeline card. Both players cry.", "[R]", "[A]", "[F]", "LORE:", "If you do not complete the", "mission, you age instantly.", "The diaper remains constant."]}, {"n": 4, "page": 2, "text": ["THE FOLIAGE", "OSHAME", "POWER: Clog:", "Block a pathway. No one moves", "until you are surgically removed.", "LORE: A diet of fast food leads to", "a legacy of posterior facial hair.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "quad": 3}, {"n": 5, "quad": 0, "text": ["THE SQUINT-", "OF GOGGLES", "POWER", "Misread: Interpret a Rule", "Card incorrectly on purpose.", "Opponents must prove you wrong.", "LORE", "The future is bright.", "Too bad you can't see it.", "IAI", "[R]", "IF1"], "page": 3}, {"quad": 1, "page": 3, "n": 6, "text": ["THE PHANTOM", "WAISTLINE", "POWER", "Space Hog: Occupy two zones at", "once. Push others into the Void.", "LORE", "Push people away, and you", "grow old alone. And by", "alone, we mean \"wide.", "[R]", "[A]", "DF1"]}, {"n": 7, "page": 3, "text": ["THE TOUPEE", "COF DENIAL", "POWER:", "Camouflage: Fail a stealth check.", "Everyone knows it's a squirrel.", "[R]", "[A]", "[F]", "LORE:", "Graceful aging is a myth", "sold by hat salesmen."], "quad": 2}, {"text": ["THE CREAKY-KNEES", "CALIPER", "CREAK", "[R]", "POWER:", "CREAK", "Rust: -5 to Agility. You can now", "HUMBUG!", "predict rain with your joints.", "LORE: The mind wants to tango.", "The cartilage wants to crumble.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "n": 8, "quad": 3, "page": 3}, {"text": ["THE BICKER-", "SCREAAM!S", "OF BUNKER", "POWER", "Stalemate: Skip your turn", "to ensure your opponent", "ACRAM_ằ", "also skips theirs.", "LORE", "Seventy years later, we", "still haven't decided who", "gets the top bunk.", "IAI", "[R]", "IFI"], "page": 4, "quad": 0, "n": 9}, {"n": 10, "quad": 1, "page": 4, "text": ["THE COOKIE", "OF CAUSALITY", "POWER", "Inciting Incident: Restart the game", "from Turn 1. Keep all damage.", "LORE", "The war didn't start over", "land or ideology. It started", "over a snickerdoodle.", "IRJ", "IAI", "DF1", "KayfaBINGO!"]}, {"page": 4, "text": ["THE SALAD DRESSING", "DIVIDER", "POWER:", "Petty Theft: Steal one resource.", "Claim it was yours for 40 years.", "IRJ", "[A]", "[FJ", "LORE:", "Robots may inherit the", "earth, but they will still", "have to listen to us argue", "about condiments."], "n": 11, "quad": 2}, {"n": 12, "page": 4, "quad": 3, "text": ["THE UNSENT", "TOMB", "POWER:", "Regret: Take 10 Psychic Damage.", "Heal an opponent 10 HP.", "LORE: He died hating you. You win", "the argument, but lose the soul.", "GW Georg v Westphalen"]}, {"page": 5, "text": ["Stay fluffy!", "THE STRIKE-FOREVER", "OF SIGN", "LUNFAIR.", "POWER", "Filibuster: Talk uninterrupted", "for 60 seconds. If you stop,", "you lose.", "LORE", "We will dismantle the", "establishment, even if we are", "decomposing while doing it.", "[F1", "IAI", "[R]"], "n": 13, "quad": 0}, {"page": 5, "text": ["THE WHEELCHAIR", "JOUST", "POWER", "Chivalry isn't dead, it's just", "on life support and very angry.", "LORE", "Joust: Roll a d6. On a 1,", "you have a heart attack.", "On a 6, opponent dies.", "•", "IRJ", "IAI", "DF1"], "n": 14, "quad": 1}, {"page": 5, "quad": 2, "n": 15, "text": ["THE GRUDGE-", "TREE", "POWER:", "Entanglement: Bind yourself to", "another player. If you fall, they fall.", "IRJ", "[A]", "[FJ", "LORE:", "Hope is for people who aren't", "stuck in a tree for 70 years", "with Harold."]}, {"quad": 3, "page": 5, "n": 16, "text": ["THE LOOP", "!@#$", "OF BLAME", "POWER:", "Recursion: Replay the last turn •", "exactly as it happened. Blame", "the dice.", "[F]", "[A]", "[R]", "LORE:", "It's your fault. No, it's my fault.", "No, it's your fault for making it", "my fault.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"]}, {"quad": 0, "page": 6, "text": ["THE SKELETON", "DELI", "OF WAITER", "TICSET", "POWER", "Hold Music: Force an opponent", "to hum a tune while you think.", "If they stop, they skip a turn.", "LORE", "Madame Foster is just finishing", "up. She's been in the craft aisle", "for three decades.", "ГF1", "IAI", "IR1"], "n": 17}, {"page": 6, "quad": 1, "text": ["THE SLIDE", "OF ETERNITY", "POWER", "Gravity Trap: You cannot leave", "this card until you roll a double.", "LORE", "The ride ends when you die.", "Please keep arms and legs", "inside the existential dread.", "0F1", "IRJ", "IAI"], "n": 18}, {"n": 19, "page": 6, "quad": 2, "text": ["THE UNANSWERED", "RIDDLE", "POWER:", "Analysis Paralysis: Force a player to", "answer a trivia question. If they", "hesitate, they freeze.", "IRJ", "[A]", "IFJ", "LORE:", "If you win, you have to keep", "playing. The only winning", "move is to be wrong."]}, {"quad": 3, "n": 20, "page": 6, "text": ["THE SOCK-", "Wrong", "number!", "PHONE", "POWER:", "Nonsense Call: Shout a random •", "phrase. Any player who laughs", "takes damage.", "IF]", "[R]", "[[A]", "LORE:", "I made a brother! He smells", "like feet and listens to my", "screams.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"]}, {"page": 7, "n": 21, "quad": 0, "text": ["THE 40TH GRADE", "OF DESK", "POWER", "Held Back: Negate a 'Level", "Up' card. You must repeat", "the tutorial.", "LORE", "There is always next year.", "And the year after that.", "Mr. Ratburn is immortal.", "IAI", "IA1", "IFI"]}, {"n": 22, "quad": 1, "text": ["THE SAFE PATH", "OF GRAVE", "POWER", "Caution: Skip your turn to gain", "+1 Defense. Bore your", "HE WAS", "opponents to death.", "CAREFUL", "LORE", "He never took a risk. His", "heart beat perfectly until the", "moment it died of boredom.", "IRJ", "IAI", "DF1"], "page": 7}, {"quad": 2, "text": ["THE UNFINISHED", "SCRIPT", "Chapter 1.", "POWER:", "Procrastination: Push any negative", "effect to the next turn. Répeat", "indefinitely.", "IRJ", "AI", "IFJ", "LORE:", "Art is 1% inspiration and 99%", "staring at a wall until you die.", "KayfaBIZARRO!"], "n": 23, "page": 7}, {"text": ["THE PARTICIPATION", "TROPHY", "POWER:", "Validation: Gain 1 point for", "doing absolutely nothing.", "IF]", "[R]", "[A]", "LORE:", "You showed up. That was the", "extent of your contribution to", "history.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 24, "quad": 3, "page": 7}, {"text": ["THE PINK SLIP ROBOT", "FIRED", "POWER:", "[R][AT[E]", "Г", "Automation: Replace your hand with a random algorithm (roll dice for actions).", "L", "LORE: The future is efficient. You are not. Please vacate the premises."], "n": 25, "page": 8, "quad": 0}, {"n": 26, "text": ["THE LASER CANE", "POWER:", "RAT[E", "Tech Upgrade: +5 Attack, but you forget who you are attacking.", "LORE: In the year 2000, the hunt doesn't require aim, just batteries."], "page": 8, "quad": 1}, {"quad": 2, "page": 8, "n": 27, "text": ["THE GYM TEACHER'S HELL", "POWER:", "[RA[F", "Payback: Reflect all damage taken in the early game back to the dealer.", "The weak shall inherit the gym, and the gym teacher shall inherit the hernia.", "L"]}, {"quad": 3, "n": 28, "text": ["THE HOVER-DIAPER", "KayfaBONGO!", "POWER:", "RZATE", "Levitation: Immune to Ground attacks. Vulnerable to Dignity attacks.", "Science conquered gravity solely to deal with incontinence.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "page": 8}, {"n": 29, "text": ["THE GARBAGE", "KINGDOM", "DICE SLOTS", "[R] [A] [F]", "BLÖDSINN!", "POWER:", "Scavenge: Draw cards", "from the discard pile.", "They smell bad.", "LORE:", "When the nanny", "throws you out, you", "become King of the", "Dump."], "page": 9, "quad": 0}, {"page": 9, "text": ["THE RETAINER", "PARTY", "DICE SLOTS", "[R] [A] [F]", "POWER:", "Isolation: You cannot", "be targeted by others.", "You also cannot win.", "LORE:", "Happy 100th Birthday.", "Your only friend Is a", "piece of dental wire."], "n": 30, "quad": 1}, {"n": 31, "text": ["THE ABYSS", "HOME", "DICE SLOTS", "[R] [A] [F]", "POWER:", "Institutionalize: Remove", "a character from play.", "They are 'safe' now.", "LORE:", "A nice place where the", "soup is warm and the", "doors are locked from", "the outside."], "page": 9, "quad": 2}, {"page": 9, "text": ["THE ZERO-G", "ROCKER", "DICE SLOTS", "[R] [A] [F]", "POWER:", "Drift: Move in a", "random direction every", "turn. Ignore physics.", "LORE:", "Rocking back and", "forth is the only", "propulsion left.", "Georg v. Westphalen", "GW"], "quad": 3, "n": 32}, {"quad": 0, "text": ["THE PEARLY GATEKEEPER", "DICE SLOTS: R", "POWER: Judgment: Reveal your", "hand. If you have any \"Stolen", "GO", "ItemsồẠại lose the game.", "AWAY"], "page": 10, "n": 33}, {"quad": 1, "n": 34, "page": 10, "text": ["THE EMPTY DANCE FLOOR", "DICE SLOTS: R] A] F", "POWER: Nostalgia: Skip your turn", "to relive a better turn from the", "past.", "LORE: The music stopped forty", "years ago, but the feet keep", "moving."]}, {"n": 35, "quad": 2, "text": ["THE DREAM-BUBBLE POP", "DICE SLOTS: R", "POWER: Wake Up: Cancel all active", "\"Future\" effects. Return to reality.", "LORE: It was all a dream. A terrible,", "wrinkly, arthritis-filled dream."], "page": 10}, {"quad": 3, "text": ["THE RESET BUTTON", "R", "DICE SLOTS:", "POWER: Meta-Strike: Drop a", "DO NOT", "16-ton weight on the Game Master.", "TOUCH", "LORE: When the plot gets too", "depressing, complain to the writers", "until they drop an anvil.", "What the", "FLUFF?!", "beorg v. Westphalen"], "page": 10, "n": 36}, {"n": 37, "page": 11, "text": ["THE DENIAL VISOR", "R", "POWER", "Effect: Block all 'Future'", "cards.", "If you can't see it, it", "isn't happening.", "LORE", "The ultimate defense", "against reality.", "Uncle F"], "quad": 0}, {"text": ["THE GRUDGE ANCHOR", "RAF", "POWER", "Effect: Prevents a", "character from moving,", "changing, or growing", "as a person.", "LORE", "Why move forward when", "you can stay here and", "rizzleBob", "be angry?"], "n": 38, "page": 11, "quad": 1}, {"page": 11, "text": ["THE NAP-TIME HAMMER", "R", "F", "POWER", "Effect: Force a 'Dream", "Sequence' turn skip on", "any player acting too", "energetic.", "LORE", "For when the young", "people are being too", "loud."], "n": 39, "quad": 2}, {"n": 40, "page": 11, "quad": 3, "text": ["nay aDiznnno.", "THE 4TH WALL BRICK", "R", "F", "POWER", "Effect: Allows player to", "rewrite the text of one", "card with a marker.", "LORE", "Escape the medium.", "Georg v. Westphalen", "GW"]}, {"page": 12, "text": ["THE FOUNTAIN OF OLD", "RAF", "POWER", "Field Effect: All", "movement speed is", "halved. Bathroom", "breaks double.", "LORE", "Drink deep and feel your", "bones liquefy."], "n": 41, "quad": 0}, {"text": ["THE MEMORY LANE MINEFIELD", "R", "F", "POWER", "Field Effect: Every step", "deals Psychic Damage", "based on past", "embarrassments.", "LORE", "Watch your step. That's", "where you called your", "teacher 'Mom'.", "RINGE", "CRINGE"], "quad": 1, "n": 42, "page": 12}, {"text": ["THE WHAT-IF WINDOW", "RAF", "POWER", "Field Effect: Looking", "through it causes", "'Depression' status.", "LORE", "Look at the life you could", "have had. Now look at", "your hand. Cry."], "n": 43, "page": 12, "quad": 2}, {"n": 44, "text": ["THE PARADOX PLAYGROUND", "F", "R", "POWER", "Field Effect: Time flows in", "reverse. Winners become", "Losers.", "LORE", "Fun for the whole family,", "assuming the family", "No.", "hasn't been erased from", "existence.", "Yesterday", "GW Georg v. Westphalen"], "page": 12, "quad": 3}, {"quad": 0, "text": ["THE GLITCH-BEAST", "RAF", "BYE", "POWER", "BYE!", "Chaos: Shuffle all", "discard piles into a", "new deck. Draw 5.", "LORE", "It hurts to exist.", "Stay"], "page": 13, "n": 45}, {"quad": 1, "text": ["THE ERASER", "IWER", "Delete: Physically tear", "up one card from an", "opponent's hand.", "The only permanent", "cure for aging."], "page": 13, "n": 46}, {"quad": 2, "text": ["HUT7*", "THE BLANK CHEQUE", "R", "POWER", "IOU", "Bluff: Pretend you", "have a winning card.", "THE END", "If no one calls you", "ONE", "IS NIGH!", "out, you win.", "FUTURE", "LORE", "Value is subjective."], "n": 47, "page": 13}, {"text": ["UNCLE FRIZZLEBOB'S EXIT", "F", "DON'T", "BYE!", "POWER", "TOO OLD", "FORGET", "Resign: Flip the table.", "FOR THIS!", "ME!", "Go outside. Play", "outside.", "LORE", "Game Over. You're", "still old. Go home.", "~ THIS WAY OUT.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "page": 13, "n": 48, "quad": 3}]}